      "loggedRequestAttempts": 0,
      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 93,
      "outputTokens": 671,
      "costUsd": 0.0060855,
      "pronunciationText": "At two seconds, x is eight minus eight, which is zero. The particle is back where it started. But it didn't sit still. Its velocity, three t squared minus four t, is negative until four thirds of a second. So first it moves left, to minus thirty-two over twenty-seven of a metre, then it turns and comes back. Its displacement is zero, but it travelled sixty-four over twenty-seven metres."
    },
